# Every synth track on modal at once, with steals inside the tracks: bass 2, lead 3, arp 2, chord 4 voices, each
# with its own structure. Notes that steal a voice wait for the host's fade.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 5.0
track bass
preset 51 110 0 0 255 35 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C2 4 110
note 4 G1 4 110
note 8 A1 4 110
note 12 F1 4 110
track lead
preset 102 170 0 0 255 90 0 0 128 0 128 170 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 E4 8 100
note 0 G4 8 100
note 0 C5 8 100
note 8 F4 8 100
note 8 A4 8 100
note 8 C5 8 100
track arp
preset 238 182 0 0 255 90 0 0 128 0 128 170 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C6 1 100
note 2 G5 1 100
note 4 E6 1 100
note 6 C6 1 100
note 8 A5 1 100
note 10 E6 1 100
note 12 F5 1 100
note 14 C6 1 100
track chord
