note 0 C3 8 90
note 0 E3 8 90
note 0 G3 8 90
note 0 B3 8 90
note 8 F3 8 90
note 8 A3 8 90
note 8 C4 8 90
note 8 E4 8 90
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 64
expect peak_below 0
